      <title>Functional Weeder — EYRC 2022</title>
      <link>https://namikxgithub.github.io/projects/functional-weeder/</link>
      <pubDate>Mon, 01 Jan 0001 00:00:00 +0000</pubDate>
      
      <guid>https://namikxgithub.github.io/projects/functional-weeder/</guid>
      <description>&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Overview
    &lt;div id=&#34;overview&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#overview&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Designed and built an autonomous weeding robot for the &lt;strong&gt;e-Yantra Robotics Competition (EYRC) 2022&lt;/strong&gt; organized by IIT Bombay. The robot navigates an agricultural arena, identifies weeds versus crops using computer vision, and performs targeted weeding operations autonomously.&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Key Features
    &lt;div id=&#34;key-features&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#key-features&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Weed Detection&lt;/strong&gt; — Vision-based classification to distinguish weeds from crops in the arena&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Precision Weeding&lt;/strong&gt; — Targeted mechanical actuation to remove weeds without damaging surrounding crops&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Autonomous Navigation&lt;/strong&gt; — Path planning through crop rows with obstacle avoidance&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Mechanical Design&lt;/strong&gt; — Custom-designed chassis and weeding mechanism optimized for the competition arena, recognized with the Best Mech Award&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Achievements
    &lt;div id=&#34;achievements&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
    &lt;span
        class=&#34;absolute top-0 w-6 transition-opacity opacity-0 -start-6 not-prose group-hover:opacity-100 select-none&#34;&gt;
        &lt;a class=&#34;text-primary-300 dark:text-neutral-700 !no-underline&#34; href=&#34;#achievements&#34; aria-label=&#34;Anchor&#34;&gt;#&lt;/a&gt;
    &lt;/span&gt;
    
&lt;/h2&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;5th Position&lt;/strong&gt; among &lt;strong&gt;400+ teams&lt;/strong&gt; nationwide&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Best Mechanical Design Award&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;

&lt;h2 class=&#34;relative group&#34;&gt;Competition
    &lt;div id=&#34;competition&#34; class=&#34;anchor&#34;&gt;&lt;/div&gt;
    
